  "description": "The Vaporesso Vibe SE 2 Pod Vape Kit is an adaptable device designed to deliver exceptional performance and convenience for mouth-to-lung vapers. Powered by a substantial 1400mAh internal battery, this kit offers extended usage times, providing up to 30 hours of operation in ECO mode. A clear tri-colour RGB LED indicator on the front panel keeps you informed of your current battery status, while USB-C charging ensures rapid top-ups when required. Standout functionality comes from the innovative physical slider located on the side of the device. This single control allows you to switch between two distinct vaping experiences. Pushing the slider to ECO mode configures the Dual Mesh smart pod to operate at 0.8ohm and 15W, optimising battery power and extending pod longevity. Sliding it to PWR mode engages the 0.6ohm resistance at 28W, increasing vapour production and delivering a more intense profile. This slider also tunes the airflow to match your chosen setting. The included 2ml Vibe smart pod features a practical top-fill design. This allows you to replenish your e-liquid without needing to remove the pod from the device, reducing downtime and potential mess. Available in a choice of textured Leather or smooth Plated chassis options, the Vaporesso Vibe SE 2 combines premium build quality with intelligent technology to create a reliable everyday vape kit.",
